1
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:39,280
ADAPTED FROM <i>THE EARLY SPRING</i> ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

3
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:44,280
Alex's job handover is almost complete.

4
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,640
The headquarters will have
a say regarding the appointment

5
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:48,000
of the next marketing manager.

6
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:51,480
We need to begin hiring now
to fill up the empty slots he left behind.

7
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:55,680
Who did he bring with him?

8
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:57,400
Annie. Ethan.

9
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:58,920
They have talked to me.

10
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,440
What about Shang Zhitao?

11
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,480
She hasn't spoken to me.

12
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,360
You care a lot about her.

13
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:11,360
I remember when she just joined,

14
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:14,000
you kept asking her to resign.

15
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:17,320
What? Finally noticed her talents?

16
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,560
Yes.

17
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,600
She is talented.

18
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,640
I want to keep her here.

19
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,440
As per our company's SOP,

20
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:28,680
HR is supposed to talk
to those who plan to leave

21
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:31,680
to understand their dissatisfaction
before persuading them to stay.

22
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:38,800
If only you knew then what you know now.

23
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:49,520
LOVE IS MAKING EXCEPTIONS

24
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,080
Is it very serious?

25
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:55,600
The patient fainted from hypoglycemia
due to not eating on time

26
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,680
and overworking.

27
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:58,640
His body just collapsed.

28
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:01,200
We will ask him to stay here for a while.

29
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:03,880
Make sure he eats properly

30
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,360
- and rests well.
- Okay. Okay.

31
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,760
Sir.

32
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:11,560
My brother works too hard.

33
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:15,240
Can you exaggerate his condition a bit?

34
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:18,520
I want him to rest here
for a few more days.

35
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:20,240
He's staying here no matter what.

36
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:21,800
As for how many days,
it depends on his recovery.

37
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:23,840
That's all.

38
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,360
- Okay.
- Thank you, Doctor.

39
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:26,360
Thanks.

40
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:33,960
Is Zhu all right?

41
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,120
He's fine.

42
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,400
Anyway,

43
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:41,040
I told the doctor that I was his sister

44
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:44,080
so that he could stay longer here
and rest.

45
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,360
Don't tell him.

46
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:47,960
Okay.

47
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:50,560
You made the right decision.

48
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:52,280
Let's check on him.

49
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,720
- This ward?
- Yes.

50
00:03:57,320 --> 00:03:58,800
Why are you sitting up?

51
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,680
Tao, how come you're here?

52
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:05,120
What do you think?

53
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,240
I'm fine.

54
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:09,880
It's just that I didn't eat and fainted.

55
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,320
How embarrassing.

56
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:16,519
It is embarrassing. You're an adult
who fainted from starvation.

57
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:19,839
Zhu. This might sound harsh.

58
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:22,920
Work is important,
but your health is what lets you work.

59
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:26,320
I know.

60
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:28,160
I accept your opinion.

61
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:31,960
I promise that I'll eat
on time from now on.

62
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:32,880
This won't happen again.

63
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,200
Swear now.

64
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:45,200
Perhaps you guys should head back first?

65
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:46,200
You have work tomorrow.

66
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,920
Kicking us out already?

67
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:50,040
The doctor said if you neglected
your health again,

68
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,280
you would be sent here.

69
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:55,120
Yes.

70
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,360
We'll be going then.

71
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:02,560
Leave him be.

72
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:05,240
Rest well.

73
00:05:05,960 --> 00:05:07,200
Drive safe.

74
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:19,680
<i>I am your dad.</i>

75
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:20,960
<i>I raised you.</i>

76
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:23,120
<i>Is it wrong to ask you to repay me now?</i>

77
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:40,520
INPATIENT ONE

78
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,160
Mom.

79
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:47,920
Didn't I just transfer
5,000 yuan to you last month?

80
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,880
All gone already?

81
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,720
Dad bet on horses again?

82
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:01,880
Mom, stop saying you're going to die.

83
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,880
If he hits you, call the police.

84
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:07,840
If that doesn't work, run away.
Call the police.

85
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:14,480
Don't worry about the money.

86
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,200
Let me finish my work first.

87
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,720
Yuanzhu.

88
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,640
Guess what I brought you.

89
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,960
Claypot rice porridge.

90
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,440
Eat while it's warm.

91
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:48,480
Take a seat.

92
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:57,600
As you know, Alex resigned.

93
00:07:57,680 --> 00:08:01,040
I arranged the meeting today
to have a conversation with you.

94
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,560
What would you like to talk about?

95
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:06,160
How's your work lately? Too much?

96
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,200
Do you have to work overtime?

97
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:11,280
Unless it's urgent,
I don't usually work overtime.

98
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,520
I do have weekends to myself.

99
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:15,320
What do you usually do during weekends?

100
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,280
Weekends?

101
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,080
Give me an example.

102
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,559
For example…

103
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,679
For example,

104
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,240
I'll hang out with my friends.

105
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:43,679
We go shopping, drink coffee,
and enjoy the sun.

106
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,960
Are you seeing anyone now?

107
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,080
No.

108
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,680
Great.

109
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:57,760
A junior of mine just came back.

110
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,840
He's three years older than you.

111
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:02,000
He's quite nice
and is from a decent family.

112
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:04,520
Should I introduce him to you?

113
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:14,080
Are you happy with the career growth
we have given you?

114
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:15,880
Yes.

115
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:20,240
Flora, if Alex has given you an offer,

116
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,160
I hope you will turn him down.

117
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,000
In a new company,

118
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:29,040
your short-term salary increase
comes with a high risk.

119
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:30,960
Staying with us

120
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:33,720
allows you to be the top player
in the industry.

121
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,280
Your bosses can always change.

122
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:38,760
Only your capability
will make you stand out.

123
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:43,000
As Luke has said,

124
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:45,720
we have our own training program
and growth option.

125
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:48,520
As long as you work hard,

126
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:51,160
you can start from a normal staff member
and become the general manager.

127
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:54,680
Additionally, our remuneration
is among the most competitive ones,

128
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:55,680
and you will receive yearly increments.

129
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:58,600
This year, we intend
to increase your salary range.

130
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,000
Tracy also mentioned to me

131
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:11,320
that your performance was highly valued
in the workplace evaluation.

132
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:15,800
I personally have seen your sacrifices,
dedication, and growth.

133
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:17,920
I agree with the evaluation.

134
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,760
So I hope

135
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:24,280
you can stay and work together with us.

136
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,480
Thank you.

137
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,560
Thank you, Luke.

138
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:44,360
When I joined Lime,

139
00:10:44,880 --> 00:10:46,880
I knew I was quite plain and average.

140
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:49,120
It was by sheer luck
that I managed to stay here.

141
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:51,680
I am grateful for everything I have now.

142
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,320
I…

143
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:55,840
I love the work ambiance here.

144
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:00,640
I love the people here.

145
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:04,480
And I know I have yet
to learn many things.

146
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:06,400
So,

147
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:08,360
Tracy,

148
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:10,480
Luke,

149
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,800
I will stay at Lime.

150
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:31,920
I'll take my leave then.

151
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:35,600
You two can discuss
the range of the increments.

152
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:45,880
Flora. Your honesty is much appreciated.

153
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:50,240
I was about to use my last bargaining chip
to convince you to stay.

154
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,800
What is it?

155
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:55,400
When Luke's scandal broke out,

156
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,880
you and Lumi came to me to attest for him.

157
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:57,880
Do you still remember that?

158
00:11:58,840 --> 00:11:59,680
Yes.

159
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:02,120
There was an investigation,

160
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:04,440
but the result was not made public.

161
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:07,400
Because Luke chose
not to pursue it further.

162
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:09,080
It involved Alex.

163
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:12,040
It's all in the past now.

164
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:15,680
I just wanted to remind you
that even if you're leaving,

165
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:18,880
make sure you know
who you're leaving with.

166
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:22,920
Noted.

167
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:27,920
How did the recruitment go?

168
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,520
We vetted through the resumes.

169
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,760
Once the first interview is done,

170
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:32,160
I'll schedule
the second interview with you.

171
00:12:37,280 --> 00:12:40,240
Are you seeing anyone now? Great.

172
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,920
A junior of mine just came back.

173
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:44,720
Should I introduce him to you?

174
00:12:46,560 --> 00:12:47,680
Now I know why your division failed

175
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:49,480
to notice someone
was poaching our manager.

176
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:51,920
Why?

177
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:56,920
You're too busy setting up dates
for your employees to work.

178
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,400
It was just a friendly chit-chat.

179
00:12:58,480 --> 00:13:00,040
Why are you so serious?

180
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:01,920
Relax.

181
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,320
I am relaxed.

182
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:05,280
But you guys might be too relaxed.

183
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:09,080
Fine. I can't win in an argument
against you.

184
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:10,000
You win.

185
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:40,440
Flora.

186
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,080
Do you have time for a stroll?

187
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:49,400
Sure.

188
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:04,320
I'm happy that you're staying.

189
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:08,080
I mean what I said today.

190
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:11,680
I'm sorry to have called you cheap

191
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:14,200
and obedient.

192
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:18,640
I was just describing
what my thinking process would be

193
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:22,080
if I were a manager
trying to poach other staff members.

194
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:24,760
I didn't mince my words.

195
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:31,200
I…

196
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:34,000
I did say a lot of things
out of spite too.

197
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:41,400
But when I reflected upon myself,
I realized some of your advice was good,

198
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:43,240
just a bit harsh.

199
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:48,120
I accept your apology

200
00:14:49,400 --> 00:14:51,400
because I know you are a gentleman.

201
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:53,960
You have never bad-mouthed Alex.

202
00:14:58,680 --> 00:15:01,960
I know I can be blunt, but I mean well.

203
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:05,120
If whatever I say ever upsets you,

204
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:06,720
you can tell me right away.

205
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:10,080
Don't block me.

206
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,240
Dealing with it is quite exhausting.

207
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:20,920
Then can you…

208
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,160
praise me more?

209
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,240
Luan Nian.

210
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:29,080
I need your encouragement.

211
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:31,720
I love it when you speak to me nicely.

212
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:34,840
Okay.

213
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,680
More encouragement and compliments.

214
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,360
I'll take note.

215
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:43,320
Do you want to eat something?

216
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:48,240
I want to eat meat
and drink a little bit. Just a little bit.

217
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:50,720
No. You bite when you're drunk.

218
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:53,440
No. I have never bitten anyone.

219
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:02,360
So when are you going to unblock me?

220
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:05,680
I'll unblock you when you buy me drinks.

221
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,040
Here. Come in, Guo.

222
00:16:28,680 --> 00:16:29,920
What are you?

223
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,480
How come you have the keys to my home?

224
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:32,600
I am an agent.

225
00:16:32,680 --> 00:16:33,960
The owner of this flat wants to sell it.

226
00:16:34,040 --> 00:16:34,960
I brought a client to view it.

227
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:36,640
You must be the tenant.

228
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,760
Move out quickly.

229
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:38,520
- Wait.
- Come in.

230
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:39,520
You must have gotten something wrong.

231
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:41,800
The owner of this property is Zhang Lei.

232
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:43,960
And Ms. Zhou is Zhang Lei's ex-wife.

233
00:16:44,040 --> 00:16:45,240
She is also a co-owner of this property.

234
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:48,080
She has the property ownership certificate
and the sales and purchase agreement.

235
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:50,000
She has authorized us
to handle this property.

236
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:50,920
Please move out quickly.

237
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:53,120
Guo, let's go inside.

238
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:54,800
The layout is good.

239
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:56,000
It is.

240
00:16:56,760 --> 00:16:57,680
<i>Lei,</i>

241
00:16:57,760 --> 00:16:59,920
<i>an agent said your ex-wife</i>
<i>would be selling the flat.</i>

242
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:01,560
<i>He brought someone to view the property.</i>

243
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:02,800
- It's not bad, right?
- Yes.

244
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:04,319
Check out that place.

245
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,079
‪It looks good.

246
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,440
<i>Tao. I'm so sorry.</i>

247
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:11,200
<i>My ex-wife lost a lot of money in her</i>
<i>investment and needs money urgently.</i>

248
00:17:11,280 --> 00:17:12,760
<i>She appointed an agent behind my back.</i>

249
00:17:12,839 --> 00:17:14,800
<i>Once I finish my work,</i>
<i>I'll buy a ticket and fly back.</i>

250
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,520
<i>Do not fight them.</i>

251
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:17,880
<i>Let me handle it when I'm there.</i>

252
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:19,240
Okay, Lei.

253
00:17:19,319 --> 00:17:20,599
Hurry up.

254
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:21,680
<i>Okay.</i>

255
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:23,720
My client is happy with this place.

256
00:17:23,800 --> 00:17:25,560
I need this property
to be vacant in two days.

257
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:26,480
Please move out soon.

258
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:29,840
Guo. Let's talk at the shop
near the entrance.

259
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:32,000
Come.

260
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:33,200
Move out now.

261
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:43,680
What do we do?

262
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:45,840
We can't find a place on short notice.

263
00:17:45,920 --> 00:17:47,240
Don't worry.

264
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:49,080
Wait for Lei to come back,
and we'll figure this out.

265
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:50,440
Yuanzhu.

266
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:53,400
Discharged already?
Are you sure you're okay?

267
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:55,680
Did Lei tell you about the eviction?

268
00:17:58,360 --> 00:18:00,560
Lei already talked to his ex-wife.
We're not moving.

269
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:02,760
We're not?

270
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:05,320
It's okay now.

271
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:08,440
That's great.

272
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:10,760
I knew it. The matter can be solved.

273
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:13,800
The most important lesson for those
who come to Beijing, eviction.

274
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:15,880
This is my third home.

275
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:18,120
If we truly are evicted,
we'll find a place together.

276
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:19,080
Right?

277
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:20,720
Don't worry.

278
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,040
GUAANZHUANG STATION

279
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:40,120
Why is it so cold here?

280
00:18:42,280 --> 00:18:43,200
A power cut?

281
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:47,200
What happened?

282
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:49,400
Sun Yu.

283
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,800
That jerk of an agent must have done this.

284
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:59,040
- Let me talk to him.
- Don't.

285
00:18:59,120 --> 00:19:01,080
We don't have proof that they did it.

286
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:05,600
They did this to make us move out.

287
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:07,520
They are bullying us.

288
00:19:08,240 --> 00:19:09,920
Tenants have rights too.

289
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:10,920
They think they are above the law?

290
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:12,400
Come. Let's confront them.

291
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,680
Yuanzhu.

292
00:19:14,760 --> 00:19:16,520
Someone trashed our home.

293
00:19:16,600 --> 00:19:17,720
Wait for us at the entrance.

294
00:19:19,240 --> 00:19:21,160
Let's head to the management office
and get the security footage.

295
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:22,960
Okay.

296
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:24,680
Lei.

297
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:26,000
- Lei.
- You're finally here.

298
00:19:26,080 --> 00:19:27,000
Where are you going?

299
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:30,120
Someone broke our window
and cut off our power supply.

300
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:31,640
I'm sure the real estate agency
by the entrance did it.

301
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:33,120
We're planning to get
the security footage.

302
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:34,680
They broke the window?

303
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:36,520
Are you two okay?

304
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:38,080
- I'm fine.
- I'm fine.

305
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:39,520
Those hooligans.

306
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:41,080
Let's check the security footage.

307
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:43,160
If they did do it,
we'll report to the police.

308
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:46,440
- The one over there?
- Yes.

309
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:47,480
That one.

310
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:52,160
Yuanzhu.

311
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:53,480
You're right on time. Come.

312
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:55,280
What?

313
00:19:55,360 --> 00:19:57,400
Don't stop us.
We checked the security footage.

314
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:59,080
This agency broke our window.

315
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:00,280
I demand compensation from them.

316
00:20:01,760 --> 00:20:03,640
Girls, you'll wait outside.

317
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:06,480
Yuanzhu is right.

318
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:09,360
Even though we notified the police,
we must make sure you are safe as well.

319
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:10,480
Take this.

320
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:11,520
- Okay.
- We'll go in first.

321
00:20:11,600 --> 00:20:13,320
- Wait for us here.
- Do not fight.

322
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:15,440
- Be civilized.
- Let's go.

323
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:16,760
Be civilized.

324
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:22,520
- Where's your manager?
- He's not here.

325
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:24,240
- Where's your manager?
- Like I said, he's not here.

326
00:20:24,320 --> 00:20:25,160
- Who broke my window?
- Just leave.

327
00:20:25,800 --> 00:20:27,120
Broke what window?
Are you looking for a fight?

328
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:28,920
- How dare you?
- Dare what?

329
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,080
- What are you doing?
- You broke my window.

330
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:31,200
- No, I did not.
- Who broke my window?

331
00:20:31,280 --> 00:20:33,160
- Are they fighting now?
- This soon?

332
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:34,240
Put those girls in a gunny sack.

333
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:35,840
- What did you just say?
- Did you touch me?

334
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:37,320
Did you push me?

335
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:39,120
How dare you threaten us?

336
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:40,440
- I'll call the police.
- You…

337
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:49,240
You… Stop!

338
00:20:49,320 --> 00:20:50,160
You…

339
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:52,000
Bugger off!

340
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:54,880
- Stop!
- Run!

341
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,600
- Stop!
- Tao. Are you okay?

342
00:20:57,680 --> 00:21:00,120
- I'm done with you!
- Throwing punches now?

343
00:21:06,320 --> 00:21:07,560
Die!

344
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:11,320
- Stop! Stop it.
- Stop.

345
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:13,400
Stop. Do you hear me?

346
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:14,560
Stop now.

347
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:16,680
- They started it.
- Are you okay?

348
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:19,040
- They hit us.
- They did it first.

349
00:21:19,120 --> 00:21:20,000
- He hit me.
- Are you all right?

350
00:21:20,080 --> 00:21:22,120
- Officer. He hit me.
- They started it.

351
00:21:22,200 --> 00:21:23,520
- Bring them back.
- Are you okay?

352
00:21:23,600 --> 00:21:24,520
Come with me for the deposition.

353
00:21:30,480 --> 00:21:33,240
FEBRUARY 14TH, UNITE WITH LOVE

354
00:21:58,760 --> 00:21:59,600
Give me your hand.

355
00:22:07,520 --> 00:22:08,800
Bear with me.

356
00:22:22,280 --> 00:22:23,840
I'll do it myself.

357
00:22:31,840 --> 00:22:32,880
Is your face okay?

358
00:22:34,240 --> 00:22:35,280
I'm fine.

359
00:22:37,120 --> 00:22:39,480
Sun Yu. Does it hurt?

360
00:22:40,320 --> 00:22:41,760
It's just a scratch. Don't worry.

361
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:44,320
Put it on.

362
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:47,000
Thanks.

363
00:22:52,120 --> 00:22:52,960
Sun Yuanzhu.

364
00:22:54,280 --> 00:22:55,240
Please

365
00:22:56,040 --> 00:22:58,560
don't get into a fight again.

366
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:00,760
You're a smart guy.

367
00:23:00,840 --> 00:23:02,240
Don't fight.

368
00:23:04,680 --> 00:23:08,160
We were just talking,
but then they threatened

369
00:23:08,760 --> 00:23:11,040
to put you two in a gunny sack
if we continued.

370
00:23:11,680 --> 00:23:12,880
So we had to be physical.

371
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:22,840
It's not worth it.

372
00:23:24,080 --> 00:23:25,360
It is.

373
00:23:25,440 --> 00:23:27,680
It is by fate that the four of us
found each other.

374
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:30,880
I wasn't there back then,
so I couldn't do much.

375
00:23:32,040 --> 00:23:33,440
Now that they threatened to harm you,

376
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:36,120
we will step in to protect you.

377
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:47,680
Guys. It's all my fault.

378
00:23:47,760 --> 00:23:49,160
I will shoulder the responsibilities.

379
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:52,720
I'll find a place for all of you
as soon as possible.

380
00:24:00,880 --> 00:24:01,880
Are we…

381
00:24:05,760 --> 00:24:07,240
parting ways now?

382
00:24:10,160 --> 00:24:11,120
Unless

383
00:24:12,360 --> 00:24:13,640
I buy this place.

384
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:17,720
But I don't have money now.

385
00:24:32,560 --> 00:24:34,480
Everything comes to an end eventually.

386
00:24:35,280 --> 00:24:36,320
People come and go.

387
00:24:38,680 --> 00:24:40,240
That's life.

388
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:57,320
I'll buy you bubble tea next time.

389
00:24:58,000 --> 00:24:58,880
Thanks.

390
00:25:00,480 --> 00:25:01,640
Tao.

391
00:25:04,040 --> 00:25:06,280
- What happened to your face?
- Nothing.

392
00:25:07,840 --> 00:25:09,280
Someone hit you?

393
00:25:10,080 --> 00:25:12,280
- Are you hurt?
- I'm fine.

394
00:25:12,360 --> 00:25:13,760
Come.

395
00:25:17,120 --> 00:25:18,520
Tell me. Who hit you?

396
00:25:20,560 --> 00:25:22,800
The real estate agency in my neighborhood.

397
00:25:24,080 --> 00:25:26,400
I see. Send me the address right now.

398
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:28,080
- I'm fine.
- Look at you now.

399
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:29,400
How is that fine?

400
00:25:30,080 --> 00:25:31,080
I don't care.

401
00:25:31,160 --> 00:25:32,240
What are you doing?

402
00:25:35,600 --> 00:25:37,240
Hello? Where are you?

403
00:25:38,120 --> 00:25:40,200
Stop eating. Someone hit my best friend.

404
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:43,160
I'll send you the address later.
You'll come with me.

405
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:47,640
They bullied my friend.

406
00:25:47,720 --> 00:25:48,880
I'm going to turn their place upside down.

407
00:25:48,960 --> 00:25:50,680
He won't even know what hit him.

408
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:55,520
Lumi. I'm fine. We called the police.

409
00:25:55,600 --> 00:25:57,440
Their place has been closed down.
It's all in the past now.

410
00:25:58,120 --> 00:26:01,480
You have no idea how scummy
a real estate agency can be.

411
00:26:01,560 --> 00:26:04,200
They intimidate you every day.
They jam your lock.

412
00:26:04,280 --> 00:26:07,280
Listen. When it comes to those jerks,
you deal with them swiftly.

413
00:26:07,360 --> 00:26:11,400
The officer told us to come to them
if anything happened.

414
00:26:11,480 --> 00:26:13,680
Police officers can do it their way.

415
00:26:13,760 --> 00:26:15,880
I can do it my way.

416
00:26:40,960 --> 00:26:41,880
Morning, Luke.

417
00:26:48,320 --> 00:26:49,560
Someone hit you.

418
00:26:51,080 --> 00:26:52,200
I fell.

419
00:26:54,600 --> 00:26:57,400
Come to my office during your lunch break
to report on your work.

420
00:27:13,960 --> 00:27:15,240
<i>What happened?</i>

421
00:27:15,320 --> 00:27:16,360
<i>You fell?</i>

422
00:27:24,400 --> 00:27:25,400
SHANG ZHITAO

423
00:27:25,480 --> 00:27:26,320
<i>Yes.</i>

424
00:27:28,560 --> 00:27:29,640
<i>Fall again.</i>

425
00:27:30,160 --> 00:27:31,920
<i>Let me see how you hit the corner</i>
<i>of your mouth.</i>

426
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:33,560
<i>I'm impressed.</i>

427
00:27:34,720 --> 00:27:36,280
<i>You landed on your face.</i>

428
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:51,240
<i>Lumi. What happened</i>
<i>to Shang Zhitao's face?</i>

429
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:58,040
<i>Hit by the scummy real estate agency.</i>

430
00:27:58,120 --> 00:27:58,960
LUMI

431
00:27:59,040 --> 00:28:00,320
<i>I just found the agency.</i>

432
00:28:13,760 --> 00:28:14,880
CHEN KUANNIAN

433
00:28:18,680 --> 00:28:19,680
Hello?

434
00:28:20,400 --> 00:28:22,400
You reported unethical businesses before,
didn't you?

435
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:26,320
An illegal agency
contravened laws by committing

436
00:28:26,400 --> 00:28:28,120
verbal assault and physical violence.

437
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:30,760
I need your help.

438
00:28:30,840 --> 00:28:31,920
We'll check it out together.

439
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:34,040
Put my name as the plaintiff.

440
00:28:47,800 --> 00:28:49,240
That agency over there.

441
00:28:49,320 --> 00:28:50,320
That one?

442
00:28:50,840 --> 00:28:52,560
It breached the contract
and attacked others.

443
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:54,600
CHENGJU REAL ESTATE

444
00:28:54,680 --> 00:28:56,200
- I'll ask around.
- Yes, please do.

445
00:28:56,280 --> 00:28:57,200
You can count on me.

446
00:29:00,320 --> 00:29:01,600
We're identifying the person in charge.

447
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:02,520
Let's wait for a bit.

448
00:29:04,560 --> 00:29:06,200
You reported them in person.

449
00:29:06,280 --> 00:29:08,200
Just who exactly are they?

450
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:09,800
Do you have any proof?

451
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:13,520
Check their fire safety regulations.

452
00:29:13,600 --> 00:29:15,280
Then check if they operate
beyond their license.

453
00:29:15,800 --> 00:29:16,840
And then, check their taxes.

454
00:29:17,960 --> 00:29:19,320
Close them down.

455
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:20,680
Investigate them one by one.

456
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:22,280
I have time.

457
00:29:23,480 --> 00:29:24,840
You're mad.

458
00:29:26,320 --> 00:29:27,960
Don't show your face.

459
00:29:28,040 --> 00:29:29,360
What if they target you?

460
00:29:59,800 --> 00:30:00,840
This is the place.

461
00:30:01,360 --> 00:30:03,400
I see this agency has a lot of enemies.

462
00:30:04,560 --> 00:30:06,400
Another group of mobs to trash the place.

463
00:30:14,840 --> 00:30:15,680
Hello?

464
00:30:15,760 --> 00:30:16,800
<i>Lumi.</i>

465
00:30:16,880 --> 00:30:19,680
Leave with your underlings now.

466
00:30:20,360 --> 00:30:22,320
I don't want to bail you out
at the police station tomorrow.

467
00:30:23,200 --> 00:30:25,560
Boss. My men are here.

468
00:30:25,640 --> 00:30:27,520
<i>We're not turning back.</i>

469
00:30:27,600 --> 00:30:29,080
<i>They hit my best friend.</i>

470
00:30:29,160 --> 00:30:31,280
<i>I'm avenging Shang Zhitao.</i>

471
00:30:32,040 --> 00:30:32,920
Just leave.

472
00:30:33,000 --> 00:30:34,880
People like them need to be
dealt with lawfully.

473
00:30:35,600 --> 00:30:38,160
Boss. You're intervening personally?

474
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:45,520
Guys, let's go back first.

475
00:30:46,240 --> 00:30:48,600
Someone will punish them for me.

476
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:49,840
Let's go.

477
00:30:56,800 --> 00:30:58,440
You know them?

478
00:31:00,400 --> 00:31:01,880
- Mister.
- Yes?

479
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:04,800
I have made several calls.

480
00:31:06,480 --> 00:31:07,600
And I did ask around.

481
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:09,520
This agency has a criminal record.

482
00:31:09,600 --> 00:31:11,280
Anyway, you have lodged a report.

483
00:31:11,360 --> 00:31:13,520
It will be handled. Don't worry.

484
00:31:13,600 --> 00:31:15,280
Thank you for the hard work.

485
00:31:15,360 --> 00:31:17,320
All right. See you.

486
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:18,520
Thank you so much.

487
00:31:18,600 --> 00:31:19,600
Don't mention it. Just doing my job.

488
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:23,560
<i>Boss.</i>

489
00:31:23,640 --> 00:31:26,000
<i>Several men in the agency</i>
<i>are straight-up cowards.</i>

490
00:31:26,080 --> 00:31:29,080
<i>They ganged up on Shang Zhitao</i>
<i>and the rest.</i>

491
00:31:29,160 --> 00:31:31,440
<i>Don't show mercy when your men hit them.</i>

492
00:31:38,480 --> 00:31:39,720
Listen.

493
00:31:39,800 --> 00:31:41,400
She had it coming.

494
00:31:41,480 --> 00:31:43,160
We were fighting, and she rushed in.

495
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:44,600
She was asking for it.

496
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:46,520
Also, look at the scratches
on Zeng's hand.

497
00:31:46,600 --> 00:31:47,440
- See?
- Look.

498
00:31:47,520 --> 00:31:50,480
The girl's face was ruined.

499
00:31:50,560 --> 00:31:54,280
Listen. If you don't hit them,
they won't learn their lesson.

500
00:31:54,360 --> 00:31:56,080
But not this harsh.

501
00:31:56,160 --> 00:31:57,280
Those are kids.

502
00:31:57,360 --> 00:31:59,040
Buddy, you must be new here.

503
00:31:59,120 --> 00:32:00,280
A new owner in this neighborhood?

504
00:32:01,560 --> 00:32:04,080
Have a cigarette. Come.

505
00:32:05,520 --> 00:32:06,440
What happened to your hand?

506
00:32:06,520 --> 00:32:08,840
Someone created a scene
at my agency several days ago.

507
00:32:08,920 --> 00:32:10,680
Two girls scratched me.

508
00:32:11,200 --> 00:32:12,160
It's fine.

509
00:32:12,680 --> 00:32:15,800
But then a jerk reported our business.

510
00:32:15,880 --> 00:32:16,800
Right?

511
00:32:21,560 --> 00:32:22,800
It was me.

512
00:32:26,720 --> 00:32:27,840
I…

513
00:32:44,280 --> 00:32:45,560
Stop.

514
00:32:46,080 --> 00:32:46,960
What the heck?

515
00:32:47,040 --> 00:32:48,040
- What are you doing?
- What the heck?

516
00:32:50,280 --> 00:32:51,760
Why did you get into a fight?

517
00:32:52,600 --> 00:32:53,760
They started it first.

518
00:32:54,280 --> 00:32:55,120
- They said they would kill me
- Assault is a crime.

519
00:32:55,200 --> 00:32:56,320
if I didn't withdraw the report.

520
00:32:57,600 --> 00:32:59,400
Trying to be a thug, aren't you?

521
00:32:59,960 --> 00:33:01,200
I'll call the police now.

522
00:33:01,280 --> 00:33:02,280
No.

523
00:33:02,360 --> 00:33:05,680
- He hit us. Look around you.
- He hit us.

524
00:33:05,760 --> 00:33:06,800
This is serious.

525
00:33:06,880 --> 00:33:08,600
They hit you hard.

526
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:10,480
I'm the one getting hit.

527
00:33:17,120 --> 00:33:18,720
They are leaving now?

528
00:33:18,800 --> 00:33:20,360
This is not over yet.

529
00:33:21,120 --> 00:33:22,880
- Get examined. We'll take your statement.
- I am just…

530
00:33:23,600 --> 00:33:25,160
- I'll head to the hospital with you.
- Enough.

531
00:33:25,240 --> 00:33:26,920
- It's standard procedure.
- I'm fine.

532
00:33:27,000 --> 00:33:28,200
They just left?

533
00:33:28,280 --> 00:33:29,360
It's just a bruise.

534
00:33:30,320 --> 00:33:31,360
Luan Nian.

535
00:33:32,080 --> 00:33:34,040
We've known each other for years.

536
00:33:34,120 --> 00:33:37,920
I didn't know you could be
such a protective boyfriend.

537
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:40,640
I couldn't believe it myself either.

538
00:33:40,720 --> 00:33:42,720
I must meet her now.

539
00:33:42,800 --> 00:33:44,280
We'll invite Song and Tan Mian.

540
00:33:45,560 --> 00:33:49,160
If you tell anyone about this,
I'll tell your wife about all your exes.

541
00:33:52,280 --> 00:33:54,160
Why are you mad?

542
00:33:54,240 --> 00:33:55,880
Do you have to go this far?

543
00:34:05,800 --> 00:34:06,760
<i>Shang Zhitao.</i>

544
00:34:06,840 --> 00:34:08,239
<i>Come down now. I'm by the entrance.</i>

545
00:34:18,639 --> 00:34:20,040
Do you not have my number?

546
00:34:22,040 --> 00:34:23,320
I do.

547
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:24,520
Why didn't you tell me
you got into a fight?

548
00:34:25,199 --> 00:34:26,679
Why didn't you tell me you got hit?

549
00:34:26,760 --> 00:34:29,080
Is my phone just for show,
or is your brain just for show?

550
00:34:30,679 --> 00:34:31,600
You're stupid.

551
00:34:31,679 --> 00:34:33,239
And your flatmates are also stupid.

552
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:34,960
Fight the scummy agency?

553
00:34:36,320 --> 00:34:37,800
Do you think you're a heroine?

554
00:34:37,880 --> 00:34:39,280
That you can defend justice?

555
00:34:40,880 --> 00:34:42,320
Did I say you could speak?

556
00:34:47,360 --> 00:34:48,480
So you don't speak
when I told you not to speak.

557
00:34:48,560 --> 00:34:50,560
Are you this obedient? Speak.

558
00:34:55,520 --> 00:34:56,360
Speak now.

559
00:34:59,680 --> 00:35:01,920
I just thought your time was precious.

560
00:35:02,000 --> 00:35:03,200
And you were always busy.

561
00:35:03,280 --> 00:35:05,320
I didn't want to trouble you
for such a trivial matter.

562
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:06,920
I can handle it.

563
00:35:09,480 --> 00:35:12,680
So getting evicted and getting hit
is a small matter, Shang Zhitao?

564
00:35:18,160 --> 00:35:19,360
What are we?

565
00:35:19,960 --> 00:35:21,480
At work, we're colleagues.

566
00:35:21,560 --> 00:35:23,360
Outside of work, we're nothing.
Is that it?

567
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:28,080
But it's not exactly
something to brag about.

568
00:35:28,760 --> 00:35:30,200
It's quite embarrassing.

569
00:35:31,240 --> 00:35:32,480
Embarrassing?

570
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:36,000
My girlfriend got hit,
and I was the last one to find out.

571
00:35:36,760 --> 00:35:38,120
That sure isn't embarrassing at all.

572
00:35:47,040 --> 00:35:47,920
Shang Zhitao.

573
00:35:48,440 --> 00:35:50,320
Did you ever view me as your boyfriend?

574
00:35:57,280 --> 00:35:59,000
Don't be mad.

575
00:35:59,080 --> 00:36:00,600
You can scold me.

576
00:36:00,680 --> 00:36:01,760
Just drive properly.

577
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:04,320
Look at your face. It's ruined.

578
00:36:06,200 --> 00:36:08,160
I've asked the doctor.

579
00:36:08,240 --> 00:36:10,240
He said it wouldn't leave a scar.

580
00:36:10,840 --> 00:36:12,400
Now you're worried about scarring.

581
00:36:12,480 --> 00:36:13,560
You deserve a scar.

582
00:36:14,680 --> 00:36:16,440
Stupid.

583
00:36:20,360 --> 00:36:21,360
Does it hurt?

584
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:24,640
Show me.

585
00:36:27,920 --> 00:36:30,000
It doesn't hurt when you show you care.

586
00:36:31,280 --> 00:36:32,120
Go away.

587
00:36:33,320 --> 00:36:34,520
Who cares about you?

588
00:36:57,720 --> 00:36:58,880
Don't be mad.

589
00:37:01,040 --> 00:37:01,920
What was that?

590
00:37:05,960 --> 00:37:06,840
You…

591
00:37:08,040 --> 00:37:09,880
How did you get hurt?

592
00:37:10,560 --> 00:37:11,520
What happened?

593
00:37:12,200 --> 00:37:13,440
It's none of your business.

594
00:37:14,760 --> 00:37:17,360
You didn't tell me everything,
so I won't tell you either.

595
00:37:20,120 --> 00:37:21,360
Did you…

596
00:37:24,120 --> 00:37:25,440
confront that agency?

597
00:37:27,280 --> 00:37:28,320
They pissed me off.

598
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:35,080
Does it hurt? Let me see.

599
00:37:35,160 --> 00:37:36,120
Where else did you get hurt?

600
00:37:36,200 --> 00:37:37,240
- It hurts.
- Show me.

601
00:37:37,920 --> 00:37:39,280
My mouth. My face. My leg.

602
00:37:39,360 --> 00:37:40,440
Everywhere hurts.

603
00:37:46,560 --> 00:37:47,400
Shang Zhitao.

604
00:37:48,600 --> 00:37:49,800
What is my number?

605
00:37:51,560 --> 00:37:52,520
I…

606
00:37:53,240 --> 00:37:54,280
I…

607
00:37:54,880 --> 00:37:55,840
Memorize it now.

608
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:08,520
Don't be mad.

609
00:38:08,600 --> 00:38:11,520
I'll do my best
to memorize your number. Okay?

610
00:38:19,320 --> 00:38:20,200
You don't know my number?

611
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:23,160
Memorize it now.

612
00:38:30,200 --> 00:38:31,040
One.

613
00:38:35,480 --> 00:38:36,680
Eight.

614
00:38:52,440 --> 00:38:53,760
Seven. Zero.

615
00:38:53,840 --> 00:38:54,880
Eight. Eight. Eight.

616
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:04,840
Call me first if anything happens.

617
00:39:24,720 --> 00:39:25,680
Do you like it?

618
00:39:28,520 --> 00:39:29,640
I do.

619
00:39:55,160 --> 00:39:56,240
Let me see.

620
00:40:00,760 --> 00:40:02,320
It's so red.

621
00:40:02,920 --> 00:40:04,800
I'm fine. No broken bones.

622
00:40:15,200 --> 00:40:16,280
Does it hurt?

623
00:40:36,160 --> 00:40:37,520
Where are you going to stay now?

624
00:40:43,440 --> 00:40:45,960
I plan to stay here for a few days.

625
00:40:46,680 --> 00:40:47,600
Can I?

626
00:40:54,120 --> 00:40:55,200
How many days?

627
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:04,680
Five days.

628
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:11,320
Sure.

629
00:41:13,120 --> 00:41:16,560
Then can I borrow your car tomorrow?

630
00:41:20,880 --> 00:41:22,040
What for?

631
00:41:23,600 --> 00:41:27,920
I need a car to carry my things.

632
00:41:30,120 --> 00:41:31,320
Knowing your driving skills,

633
00:41:32,080 --> 00:41:32,920
I won't let you drive my car.

634
00:41:36,280 --> 00:41:37,400
I'll drive you there.

635
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:40,280
Tomorrow after work?

636
00:41:40,800 --> 00:41:41,640
Okay.

637
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:44,880
Oh.

638
00:41:45,880 --> 00:41:48,280
Tomorrow, I have a new flatmate.

639
00:41:52,080 --> 00:41:53,040
A new flatmate?

640
00:42:13,760 --> 00:42:14,760
Closed down?

641
00:42:15,440 --> 00:42:17,000
How come?

642
00:42:17,080 --> 00:42:18,840
I haven't even done anything.

643
00:42:22,560 --> 00:42:24,080
Someone made a report
about their fire safety regulations?

644
00:42:25,680 --> 00:42:27,240
They got hit as well?

645
00:42:28,400 --> 00:42:30,120
Locked up in the police station?

646
00:42:31,240 --> 00:42:32,280
I see.

647
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:38,000
Our boss just taught those pricks

648
00:42:38,600 --> 00:42:40,840
who hit you a lesson.

649
00:42:41,840 --> 00:42:42,760
Who…

650
00:42:42,840 --> 00:42:44,000
Who?

651
00:42:45,320 --> 00:42:47,440
Luan Nian. Our boss.

652
00:42:47,520 --> 00:42:49,240
He's amazing.

653
00:42:49,320 --> 00:42:50,480
As our boss,

654
00:42:50,560 --> 00:42:53,800
he goes out of his way
to take care of our well-being.

655
00:42:55,440 --> 00:42:56,600
What did I tell you, Shang Zhitao?

656
00:42:57,360 --> 00:42:58,920
Luan Nian treats you differently.

657
00:43:00,080 --> 00:43:01,800
How did you know it was him?

658
00:43:02,560 --> 00:43:05,280
I was there. Then he called me
to ask me to go back.

659
00:43:06,320 --> 00:43:07,680
Tao.

660
00:43:07,760 --> 00:43:09,960
You must thank him this time.

661
00:43:11,880 --> 00:43:14,600
I know. I will thank him properly.

662
00:43:14,680 --> 00:43:18,040
And thank you too, Lumi,
for standing up for me.

663
00:43:18,120 --> 00:43:22,160
But please don't tell anyone about this.
It'll look bad.

664
00:43:23,880 --> 00:43:25,320
What's there to be afraid of? Why?

665
00:43:29,240 --> 00:43:32,080
I need to rush the proposal
regarding the two interns.

666
00:43:32,160 --> 00:43:33,800
Otherwise, I won't be able to go home.

667
00:43:33,880 --> 00:43:35,160
Go then.

668
00:43:35,240 --> 00:43:38,000
Mentoring an intern
is quite challenging at the beginning.

669
00:43:38,800 --> 00:43:40,840
It reminds me of the time
when you mentored me.

670
00:43:40,920 --> 00:43:42,200
It must have been tough on you.

671
00:43:42,280 --> 00:43:44,280
Don't humble yourself.

672
00:43:44,360 --> 00:43:45,800
I taught everyone the same thing.

673
00:43:45,880 --> 00:43:48,360
It's up to them
how they use the knowledge.

674
00:43:48,440 --> 00:43:50,000
And you did so well.

675
00:43:50,080 --> 00:43:50,920
All the best.

676
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:54,600
Work hard, work more, so that I can chill.

677
00:43:55,600 --> 00:43:57,600
Yes. I work hard. You chill.

678
00:44:06,600 --> 00:44:07,360
LUAN NIAN

679
00:44:07,440 --> 00:44:08,400
<i>See you at the parking lot.</i>

680
00:44:17,080 --> 00:44:20,360
<i>I need to head to a place</i>
<i>to pick up my new flatmate.</i>

681
00:44:20,440 --> 00:44:22,440
PETISM

682
00:44:45,080 --> 00:44:45,920
Luan Nian.

683
00:45:20,600 --> 00:45:22,120
MISSING OWNER

684
00:45:22,200 --> 00:45:23,520
It's still here.

685
00:45:24,280 --> 00:45:26,560
- We're here to check on this dog.
- Sure.

686
00:45:26,640 --> 00:45:27,520
Puppy.

687
00:45:28,800 --> 00:45:29,880
- Hey.
- Puppy.

688
00:45:32,680 --> 00:45:33,920
Give him some water.

689
00:45:34,000 --> 00:45:36,040
- He's so obedient.
- Right?

690
00:45:36,120 --> 00:45:40,080
We put up the notice three months ago,
but no one came to claim him.

691
00:45:40,800 --> 00:45:42,680
We can't keep him in a pet store forever.

692
00:45:44,360 --> 00:45:46,800
Shang Zhitao, why are you so lucky?

693
00:45:46,880 --> 00:45:48,640
You ran into a Samoyed.

694
00:45:48,720 --> 00:45:50,280
It costs several thousand yuan for one.

695
00:45:52,600 --> 00:45:56,360
Do you think I can raise it?

696
00:45:57,520 --> 00:45:58,480
Sure.

697
00:45:59,040 --> 00:46:00,560
I love dogs too.

698
00:46:00,640 --> 00:46:02,160
I love them.

699
00:46:02,240 --> 00:46:03,800
If you want to raise him,
let's do it together.

700
00:46:04,320 --> 00:46:05,960
If Lei and Yuanzhu
are not allergic to fur,

701
00:46:06,040 --> 00:46:07,560
we can bring him home to live with us.

702
00:46:10,400 --> 00:46:11,760
What is your name?

703
00:46:11,840 --> 00:46:13,600
Let's give you a name.

704
00:46:13,680 --> 00:46:15,480
You will be…

705
00:46:17,280 --> 00:46:19,520
Luke. Luke.

706
00:46:19,600 --> 00:46:21,680
What? What's his name?

707
00:46:21,760 --> 00:46:22,880
Luke.

708
00:46:23,520 --> 00:46:26,880
If the Luke at work bullies me,
I'll come back and bully you.

709
00:46:28,000 --> 00:46:29,280
Is this how you do your work?

710
00:46:29,360 --> 00:46:31,320
If you can't do it, just resign.

711
00:46:31,400 --> 00:46:34,000
Bad boy. Luke.

712
00:46:34,080 --> 00:46:35,600
- Sure. I like that name.
- Luke.

713
00:46:35,680 --> 00:46:36,640
You can destress.

714
00:46:39,800 --> 00:46:41,480
Luke.

715
00:46:43,920 --> 00:46:45,560
Does this mean you miss him a lot?

716
00:46:47,120 --> 00:46:48,360
No.

717
00:46:48,440 --> 00:46:50,160
Luke. Luke.

718
00:46:50,240 --> 00:46:51,080
Luke.

719
00:46:51,160 --> 00:46:52,920
I think he likes the name.

720
00:46:53,000 --> 00:46:54,480
Luke, you have a home now.

721
00:46:55,640 --> 00:46:56,720
Let's go home.

722
00:46:56,800 --> 00:46:58,280
Let's go home.
